{
    "word": "cofferdam",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "bf52ce60-983b-3724-8153-f2f4f17d7050",
                "word": "cofferdam",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2b054e41-3228-4099-acd2-f09dfaec74d4",
                        "entry_id": "bf52ce60-983b-3724-8153-f2f4f17d7050",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "cofferdams"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3835ec2c-3faa-31f4-ba4e-dd3d43a4966a",
                        "entry_id": "bf52ce60-983b-3724-8153-f2f4f17d7050",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A temporary watertight enclosure used to create a dry foundation for building bridges and other structures over water."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8395ccfb-456a-461b-b155-909244e2cdf1",
                                "sense_id": "3835ec2c-3faa-31f4-ba4e-dd3d43a4966a",
                                "text": "He stood full six feet in height, with noble shoulders, and a chest like a coffer-dam."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8747c4f7-0140-4b4d-819f-45efd5eb2731",
                                "sense_id": "3835ec2c-3faa-31f4-ba4e-dd3d43a4966a",
                                "text": "Downstream there was a small wooden cofferdam and when he woke there were naked children splashing in the pool there and he rose and wrapped his jacket about his waist and walked out along the bank where he could sit and watch them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5d7a231-8ecb-4c56-aa21-e1e3482703d7",
                                "sense_id": "3835ec2c-3faa-31f4-ba4e-dd3d43a4966a",
                                "text": "At fixed injection volume of PVC gels solution, the curvature of MLAs [(microlens arrays)] obtained with patterned electrode substrates at fixed sizes of cofferdam can be tuned by changing the preparation voltage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "51c1e8ad-5ae8-47e8-8985-0122e2ea7319",
                                "sense_id": "3835ec2c-3faa-31f4-ba4e-dd3d43a4966a",
                                "text": "Where the viaduct crosses the lake, the piles will be bored directly into the lakebed, using a cofferdam to hold back the water while the pier is built."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bb3d7ea8-cb9a-30e2-90da-40bd1319d16f",
                        "entry_id": "bf52ce60-983b-3724-8153-f2f4f17d7050",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An empty space that acts as a protective barrier between two floors or bulkheads on a ship."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e2eb6607-6d4f-36e1-bb31-f933f008102d",
                        "entry_id": "bf52ce60-983b-3724-8153-f2f4f17d7050",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A rubber dam to keep the teeth dry when operating upon them."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "New-York"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "df95c43f-6c8c-4db1-b23e-c8f6b3e75d74",
                                "sense_id": "e2eb6607-6d4f-36e1-bb31-f933f008102d",
                                "text": "I refer to Dr. Barnum, who has given us the coffer-dam. I cannot detain you while I describe the immense benefit which his application of a very simple material has conferred on the public."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b13dff0-5e7d-40d1-8f51-08e29e4d8145",
                                "sense_id": "e2eb6607-6d4f-36e1-bb31-f933f008102d",
                                "text": "Dr. La Roche then first we are informed made the claim that he knew of and used rubber for a coffer dam prior to Barnum."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0271f74b-4b42-4bde-a37a-84451cf26782",
                        "source_entry_id": "bf52ce60-983b-3724-8153-f2f4f17d7050",
                        "source_sense_description": "temporary watertight structure",
                        "target_lang_word": "kistdam",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kistdam",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "adfb80a9-817c-32e3-ba19-cb83a7a31b7e",
                                        "entry_id": "afde2f53-2eb5-34fd-ab20-0e9d4e9db506",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "tijdelijke dam die men gebruikt bij hoogwater"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "waterbeheer"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f6aab27-01bf-4622-8c79-5467fe4737da",
                                                "sense_id": "adfb80a9-817c-32e3-ba19-cb83a7a31b7e",
                                                "text": "Het sluiten van de stadspoort in vestingstad Woudrichem gebeurt door balken in sleuven te schuiven, waarbij tussen de balken zand wordt gestort. Dit maakt de poort waterdicht. Het is voor het eerst in zes jaar dat de zogenoemde kistdam wordt opgebouwd, zo vertelde Waterschap Rivierenland zaterdag aan Omroep Brabant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "612a02ae-d4e8-31c4-b519-a8c2cb8fc984",
                                        "entry_id": "afde2f53-2eb5-34fd-ab20-0e9d4e9db506",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "een tijdelijke omsluiting gebouwd in het water om het omsloten gebied leeg te pompen. Op die manier kan men een droge werkomgeving creëren voor grote werkzaamheden"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "waterbeheer"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ac1be98-c31a-4cb8-889a-abc8f043fc3b",
                                                "sense_id": "612a02ae-d4e8-31c4-b519-a8c2cb8fc984",
                                                "text": "De aanleg van een zogenoemde kistdam moet ervoor zorgen dat het gebied rond de bruggen droog komt te liggen. De Niagara Falls, die op de grens van de Verenigde Staten en Canada liggen, bestaan uit drie watervallen: de Bridal Veil Falls, de American Falls en de Horseshoe Falls."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f33ab8f6-722d-4ab0-bb7d-f8cb17283303",
                        "source_entry_id": "bf52ce60-983b-3724-8153-f2f4f17d7050",
                        "source_sense_description": "temporary watertight structure",
                        "target_lang_word": "batardeau",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "batardeau",
